up a Node2D scene with background graphics of choice\n2: add a BackBufferCopy node and a Sprite2D with any texture\n3: add a shader to above mentioned Sprite2D with a shader that uses `hint_screen_texture`. [This one from the docs](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/tutorials/shaders/screen-reading_shaders.html) for example.\n4: change the copy mode of the BackBufferCopy mode to and from Rect while panning and zooming the editor view and moving the different nodes to see how the buffer in the shader fails to be updated.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[BackBufferCopyTest.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/22627914/BackBufferCopyTest.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"BluesM18A1","id":36201999,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MjAxOTk5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36201999?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BluesM18A1","html_url":"https://github.com/BluesM18A1","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BluesM18A1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BluesM18A1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BluesM18A1/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BluesM18A1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BluesM18A1/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BluesM18A1/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BluesM18A1/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BluesM18A1/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BluesM18A1/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111096/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111096/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null